{
  "description": "A 包，覆盖各类入参的输入形态（评审 I4）：Double（整数 token 与小数 token）、Long（安全整数 token 与 int64 十进制字符串，结果超出 2⁵³ 用于无损比较）、List、Map（Text 键）、Maybe（null 为 None）、无载荷 Enum（变体名字符串）、Int 的 int32 边界。字符串形态 Long 的期望值取自 ts（平台 /evaluate-json 把 JSON 字符串当 Text）。",
  "package": "a-inputs",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "double-integer-token",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-inputs",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"d\":3}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"2d206cb0607afed95bdf1309a327d86c99fdb5e6023ee285d4f6a96f89d7aa07\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"half\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":1.5}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    },
    {
      "name": "double-fraction-token",
      "args": [
        "run",
        "a-inputs",
        "--input",
        "-",
        "--jwks",
        "../keys/test-jwks.json"
      ],
      "stdin": "{\"d\":3.5}",
      "expectedStdout": "{\"meta\":{\"cliVersion\":\"<CLI_VERSION>\",\"coreIrSha256\":\"2d206cb0607afed95bdf1309a327d86c99fdb5e6023ee285d4f6a96f89d7aa07\",\"engine\":\"<ENGINE>\",\"entry\":\"half\",\"irRecompiled\":false,\"signed\":true},\"ok\":true,\"value\":1.75}\n",
      "expectedExit": 0,
      "code": null
    },
